{"id":"6b749704e82fc727","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-cnf.md","title":"Conjunctive normal form","display":"df-cnf — Conjunctive normal form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-cnf","aliases":["27-df-cnf"],"display":"df-cnf — Conjunctive normal form","depends_on":["[[27-df-clause]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.4 Definition 1.10 and empty-family convention","source_printed_pages":"15","source_pdf_pages":"39","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-cnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cnf — Conjunctive normal form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.4 Definition 1.10 and empty-family convention"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"15"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clause}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_n\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Clause}_n),\\qquad\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{K\\in C}K(a)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Clause}_n),\\qquad\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{K\\in C}K(a)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ C⟧_{\\wedge}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C),\\qquad\\prod_{K\\in\\emptyset}K(a)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ C⟧_{\\wedge}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C),\\qquad\\prod_{K\\in\\emptyset}K(a)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有子句非恒真，且空子句属于 Clause_n。空 CNF 恒真，包含空子句的 CNF 恒假。显式求值映射消除与 DNF 空表示的歧义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Clause}_n$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]；$C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_n$，$a\\in\\mathbb B^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Clause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Clause}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Clause}_n),\\qquad\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{K\\in C}K(a)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"⟦ C⟧_{\\wedge}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C),\\qquad\\prod_{K\\in\\emptyset}K(a)\\coloneqq1.","display":true}],"bytes":1217,"backlinks":[{"id":"dcd0fe504d1a1cb0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ (CNF representation, see [[27-df-cnf]])"},{"id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]、[[27-df-boolexpr]]。字串以 $[r]$ 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。$E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$；$\\iota$ 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限树语法。"},{"id":"7c550fd5ce4d17c6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf|df-cnf — Conjunctive normal form]]"},{"id":"32221074998ee3fd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-cnf]]，在子句集上取合取求值。"},{"id":"8c0a6e3c38dda0eb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；规范形式见 [[27-df-canonicalforms]]，求值见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{CLits}$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]。"},{"id":"f47e52113c1c33ee","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]]."},{"id":"fc6ee0d11ecfb0f6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]]."},{"id":"c841e9e05634a859","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]]."},{"id":"7335041040d1b313","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]]."},{"id":"16198f47b39efd85","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ with evaluation $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n$ (see [[27-df-dnf]], [[27-df-cnf]])"},{"id":"bf5ab72b4278710c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$D_1,D_2,C_1,C_2$ 是下式构造的四个表示；DNF、CNF 见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]。"},{"id":"6eb8cb81a30e51d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；$\\mathrm{PrimeIct}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-implicates]]，$\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-cnf]]。"},{"id":"698a77a0557fd7dc","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n:\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-cnf]]."}],"outgoing":["74438714e304bba9"]}